OL,3,APrioritise young people or risk a 'lost
OL,4,Ageneration', says Milburn, ahead of
OL,5,Amajor report
OL,6,
OL,7,FA major review will propose widespread
OL,8,Fchanges to tax, welfare, and education
OL,9,Fto help get young people into work
OL,10,Facross the UK
OL,12,FThe government-backed report by Alan
OL,13,FMilburn will be released in full at
OL,14,F11:30 GMT - he tells the BBC the
OL,15,Fgovernment must prioritise young people
OL,16,For risk a "lost generation"
OL,18,FHe also says his proposed changes are
OL,19,Fnot about saving money, but instead
OL,20,Fabout "improving young people's lives"
OL,21,F- but he adds billions could be saved
OL,22,Ffrom the benefits bill within 10 years
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
