OL,3,APrioritise young people or risk a 'lost
OL,4,Ageneration', says Milburn, ahead of
OL,5,Amajor report
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost one million people aged 16 to 24
OL,8,Fare not in education, employment or
OL,9,Ftraining - a rate of 13%, which Milburn
OL,10,Fwants to fall to 5% within a decade
OL,12,FTo do that, he's proposing that
OL,13,Funder-25s should no longer be able to
OL,14,Fclaim the health element of universal
OL,15,Fcredit; lower rates of National
OL,16,FInsurance for employing young people;
OL,17,Fand more apprenticeships
OL,19,FThe Conservatives say his report is
OL,20,F"too cautious" in parts - and too
OL,21,Freliant on the "expensive hand of the
OL,22,Fstate"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
