OL,3,AImran Khan seeks urgent medical care
OL,4,Afearing he 'may not return alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhan, who faces more than 100 charges,
OL,7,Fhas been in prison since August 2023.
OL,8,FHis wife Bushra Bibi was jailed along
OL,9,Fwith him last year. Khan argues the
OL,10,Fcases against them, ranging from
OL,11,Fcorruption to selling state gifts, are
OL,12,Fpolitically motivated.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
